          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 26:1-51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mnamo siku ya kwanza ya mwezi wa pili, mwaka wa pili baada ya wana wa Israeli kutoka Misri, Mwenyezi-Mungu aliongea na Mose ndani ya hema la mkutano jangwani Sinai, akamwambia hivi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe na Aroni fanyeni sensa ya jumuiya yote ya Waisraeli, familia mojamoja kwa kufuata koo zao na idadi ya majina yao kila mwanamume mmojammoja; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wale wote katika Israeli wanaoweza kwenda vitani, wenye umri kuanzia miaka ishirini na zaidi, mtawaweka katika orodha ya vikosi vikosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena mwanamume mmoja wa kila kabila atakuwa pamoja nanyi, kila mmoja aliye kiongozi wa jamaa za kabila lake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haya ndiyo majina ya watu watakaokusaidia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
