              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hawa ndio watu waliokuwa wamehesabiwa ambao Mose na Aroni waliwahesabu wakisaidiwa na wale viongozi kumi na wawili wa Israeli, kila kiongozi akiwakilisha ukoo wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
